<title>POLAND: DEBICA MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 7.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>DEBICA MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 7.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.25 vs   6.81</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 9.51 vs   9.44</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.39 vs   9.19</p>
<p> Sales		   59.86 vs  54.78</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	    19.52 vs  12.29</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	28.52 vs  17.24</p>
<p> Operating profit    18.48 vs  19.08</p>
<p> Sales		  164.94 vs 134.85</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is TC Debica SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
